<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P rates Denmark's yen/Aussie dual samurai AA+.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Denmark's yen/Aussie dual samurai AA+.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Tuesday it had assigned its AA+ rating to two tranches of yen/Australian dollar dual-currency samurai bonds issued by Denmark.</p>
<p>The tranches are worth 10 billion and 20 billion yen, and mature on January 13, 2000.</p>
</text>
